{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 2026-05-14 - AI算力芯片系统-主板卖铲人\n\n资料脑图｜按原文结构生成",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "1",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 来源信息\n- 作者 / 坤元财研\n- 视频发布时间 / 2026-04-21",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "原主题 / AI 算力芯片系统、GPU/ASIC/CPU/存储芯片竞争格局",
      "x": -79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "内容质量 / full：metadata + 机器转写",
      "x": 79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 待核验问题\n- 视频提到的全球训练、国内训练、全球推理市场份额是否有 IDC、Gartner、Omdia 或券商研报支持。\n- 云厂商自研 ASIC、AMD ROCm 生态、NVLink Fusion 等说法是否有官方发布或可信报道。",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "HBM、CPU、SSD 相关公司能否映射到 A 股/港股/美股可研究标的。",
      "x": 1071,
      "y": -46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "“卖铲人”叙事是否已经被市场充分定价，需要用财报、订单、库存和资本开支验证。",
      "x": 1071,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 来源声称\n- 模块 / 视频声称的角色 / 待核验方向\n- GPU / ASIC / 大模型训练和推理的核心算力芯片 / <span style=\"color:#d6a100\">英伟达<…",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "HBM / 解决 GPU 等数据的内存瓶颈 / HBM 供应格局、容量迭代、国产替代可能性",
      "x": 79,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CPU / 调度数据流和管理指令 / x86、Arm、国产 CPU 在 AI 服务器中的份额变化",
      "x": -79,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 关键假设\n- 训练市场和推理市场的技术要求、成本结构、竞争格局不同，不能用同一套估值逻辑看待。\n- <span style=\"color:#d6a100\">英伟达</span>的护城河不仅来自 GPU，也来自 CUDA、N…",
      "x": -720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "云厂商自研 ASIC 可能在推理成本上形成压力，但短期仍很难完全替代<span style=\"color:#d6a100\"…",
      "x": -1071,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CPU、HBM、SSD 等“主板边缘环节”可能随着 AI 服务器系统化升级获得重新定价。",
      "x": -1071,
      "y": -46,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    }
  ],
